---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy — Pluto Night Labs" description="Privacy information for the Pluto Night Labs website.">
  <section class="privacy shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Simple by design.</h1>
    <p class="lede">This website does not use cookies, analytics or tracking technologies.</p>
    <div class="privacy-copy">
      <h2>Information we receive</h2>
      <p>We do not automatically collect personal information through this website. If you choose to email us or request a playtest invitation using your email application, we receive the address and information you choose to send.</p>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>We use enquiries to respond to messages. If you explicitly request playtest invitations, we may also contact you about relevant game testing opportunities and your selected interests. You can withdraw that request at any time by emailing hello@plutonightlabs.com with the subject 'Stop playtest invites'. We do not sell your personal information or add you to marketing communications without your permission.</p>
      <h2>Email updates and newsletter signups</h2>
      <p>When our optional email signup becomes available, it will link to a MailerLite-hosted form. You will choose whether to subscribe and provide your email directly to MailerLite. We will use that subscription only for Pluto Night Labs news, game playtests, beta opportunities and launches. You can unsubscribe through the link in any newsletter. MailerLite processes signup information under <a href="https://www.mailerlite.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">its privacy notice</a>. Following that link opens MailerLite's own website, not an embedded tracker here.</p>
      <p>Requesting a specific playtest invitation by email is separate from subscribing to general updates; we won't automatically transfer invitation requests into the newsletter.</p>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>For questions about privacy, email <a href={`mailto:${site.supportEmail}`}>{site.supportEmail}</a>.</p>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: October 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy { min-height: 70vh; padding-block: 130px 150px; }
  h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 7vw, 6.5rem); line-height: .94; letter-spacing: -.06em; }
  .lede { max-width: 700px; margin: 32px 0 70px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.22rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  .privacy-copy { max-width: 720px; padding-top: 48px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  h2 { margin: 38px 0 12px; font-size: 1.25rem; } h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .privacy-copy p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.8; } .privacy-copy a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .updated { margin-top: 50px; color: var(--dim) !important; font-size: .8rem; }
</style>
